---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { legal } from "../../data/legal";
---
<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Website privacy | CongTrinhSnap" description="Information about technical data processed when you visit the CongTrinhSnap website.">
<SiteHeader />
<main id="main">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">Website information</span><h1>Website privacy</h1><p>Last updated: {legal.effectiveDate}</p></div></section>
<article class="prose">
<p>The separate <strong>Android app Privacy Policy</strong> for Construction Manager (package <code>{legal.packageName}</code>) is available at <a href="/app-privacy">/app-privacy – App Privacy Policy</a>. This page applies only to the website <a href={legal.siteUrl}>{legal.siteUrl.replace("https://", "")}</a>.</p>
<p>This is a public information website. It does not provide user accounts or store project records, photos or project data created by users in the app.</p>
<h2>1. Operator and contact</h2>
<p>The website is operated by <strong>{legal.legalName}</strong> under the <strong>{legal.brandName}</strong> brand.<br />Contact address: {legal.legalAddress}<br />Email: <a href={"mailto:" + legal.supportEmail}>{legal.supportEmail}</a></p>
<h2>2. Technical data when you visit</h2>
<p>The website hosting provider, Cloudflare, may process technical information needed to deliver content, maintain the service and protect the website, such as IP address, browser/device information, access time and security logs. Cloudflare's processing is subject to its own policies and terms, including its <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<h2>3. Analytics and cookies</h2>
<p>As of this policy update, the deployed website source does not integrate third-party traffic analytics tools such as Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager, Plausible, Umami or PostHog. The website does not intentionally set advertising or analytics cookies. The infrastructure provider may use technical mechanisms necessary for security and operation according to its service configuration.</p>
<p>If we add analytics, cookies or tracking technologies in the future, we will update this policy and provide an appropriate notice/choice mechanism before activation where required.</p>
<h2>4. Links to external websites</h2>
<p>The website may link to Google Play, GitHub, Cloudflare or other services. When you open an external link, the relevant website/provider processes data under its own policies; we do not control those activities.</p>
<h2>5. Data requests</h2>
<p>If you have a question or request concerning personal information arising from your visit to this website, contact us using the email above. Do not send passwords, verification codes or unnecessary sensitive data.</p>
<h2>6. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this page when the hosting provider, website configuration or data practices change. The latest update date appears at the top of this page.</p>
</article>
</main>
<SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
